<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Sets the specified integer on the effect.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>The effect Engine Data structure is used to communicate with the game  engine and can only be written to and not read from scripting. It is  distinct from general purpose Effect Data structure which was previously  used to exchange information.
</p><p>This function should not be confused with <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/SetEffectInteger" title="SetEffectInteger">SetEffectInteger</a>.
</p>
